{"html":"<h1 id=\"performance\">Performance</h1>\n<p>Two different questions use two separate tables.</p>\n<h2 id=\"native-language-comparison\">Native language comparison</h2>\n<p>Programming-language comparisons use native machine-code artifacts on the same Linux x64 runner. Each ratio is VKF time divided by the competitor time, so a value below <code>1×</code> means VKF was faster. The release selector shows only evidence measured for that exact VKF version.</p>\n<section class=\"release-panel\" data-release-version=\"0.4.5\"><p><strong>VKF 0.4.5</strong> · Spectral norm + Fannkuch + N-body · 100 measured runs after 3 warmups on GitHub Linux x64, one pinned logical CPU.</p><div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"VKF 0.4.5 native language comparison\"><table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Workload</th><th scope=\"col\">VKF mean ± std (ms)</th><th scope=\"col\">VKF / C++</th><th scope=\"col\">VKF / Rust</th><th scope=\"col\">VKF / Zig</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Spectral norm + Fannkuch + N-body</td><td>14.391 ± 0.181</td><td>0.390×</td><td>0.428×</td><td>0.407×</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>One-time policy search tested 2,560 masks in 101,077.556 ms; cached compilation did not repeat it. <a href=\"https://vektorflow.org/benchmarks/core-0.4.5.html\">Version-matched benchmark evidence</a></p><p><a href=\"https://vektorflow.org/downloads/v0.4.5/manifest.json\">Release files and checksums</a></p></section>\n<section class=\"release-panel\" data-release-version=\"0.4.4\" hidden><p><strong>VKF 0.4.4</strong></p><p>No version-matched native peer comparison was published for this release. This page does not substitute results from another VKF version.</p><p><a href=\"https://vektorflow.org/downloads/v0.4.4/manifest.json\">Release evidence</a></p><p><a href=\"https://vektorflow.org/downloads/v0.4.4/manifest.json\">Release files and checksums</a></p></section>\n<section class=\"release-panel\" data-release-version=\"0.4.3\" hidden><p><strong>VKF 0.4.3</strong></p><p>No version-matched native peer comparison was published for this release. This page does not substitute results from another VKF version.</p><p><a href=\"https://vektorflow.org/benchmarks/browser-0.4.3.html\">Release evidence</a></p><p><a href=\"https://vektorflow.org/downloads/v0.4.3/manifest.json\">Release files and checksums</a></p></section>\n<section class=\"release-panel\" data-release-version=\"0.4.0\" hidden><p><strong>VKF 0.4.0</strong></p><p>No version-matched native peer comparison was published for this release. This page does not substitute results from another VKF version.</p><p><a href=\"https://vektorflow.org/downloads/v0.4.0/manifest.json\">Release evidence</a></p><p><a href=\"https://vektorflow.org/downloads/v0.4.0/manifest.json\">Release files and checksums</a></p></section>\n<h2 id=\"vkf-native-versus-webassembly\">VKF native versus WebAssembly</h2>\n<p>This is a runtime-format comparison for the selected release, not a programming-language comparison.</p>\n<section class=\"release-panel\" data-release-version=\"0.4.5\"><p>Strict 100-run native peer comparison and three-browser direct-WASM gate below 3x same-host native VKF. Spectral norm (small, n=100); mean ± sample SD milliseconds; 10 warmups and 100 measured runs on GitHub macOS 15, Apple M1 (Virtual). macOS is the common host that can run Chrome, Firefox, and Safari.</p><div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"VKF 0.4.5 native versus WebAssembly benchmark\"><table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">VKF runtime</th><th scope=\"col\">Mean ± sample SD (ms)</th><th scope=\"col\">Relative to native</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Native VKF · macOS arm64</td><td>5.042 ± 0.353</td><td>1.00×</td></tr><tr><td>VKF WebAssembly · Chrome (V8)</td><td>7.954 ± 1.371</td><td>1.58×</td></tr><tr><td>VKF WebAssembly · Firefox (SpiderMonkey)</td><td>8.570 ± 0.685</td><td>1.70×</td></tr><tr><td>VKF WebAssembly · Safari (JavaScriptCore)</td><td>1.900 ± 0.333</td><td>0.38×</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p><a href=\"https://vektorflow.org/benchmarks/browser-0.4.5.html\">Benchmark evidence</a></p><p><a href=\"https://vektorflow.org/downloads/v0.4.5/manifest.json\">Release files and checksums</a></p></section>\n<section class=\"release-panel\" data-release-version=\"0.4.4\" hidden><p>Ten-run correctness release measurement; no speed threshold. No same-host VKF native-versus-WebAssembly benchmark was published for this release.</p><p><a href=\"https://vektorflow.org/downloads/v0.4.4/manifest.json\">Release files and checksums</a></p></section>\n<section class=\"release-panel\" data-release-version=\"0.4.3\" hidden><p>Ten-run VKF native versus WebAssembly correctness measurement; no speed threshold. Spectral norm (small, n=100); mean ± sample SD milliseconds; 3 warmups and 10 measured runs on GitHub macOS 15.7.9, Apple M1. macOS is the common host that can run Chrome, Firefox, and Safari.</p><div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"VKF 0.4.3 native versus WebAssembly benchmark\"><table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">VKF runtime</th><th scope=\"col\">Mean ± sample SD (ms)</th><th scope=\"col\">Relative to native</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Native VKF · macOS arm64</td><td>7.047 ± 1.828</td><td>1.00×</td></tr><tr><td>VKF WebAssembly · Chrome (V8)</td><td>36.480 ± 9.117</td><td>5.18×</td></tr><tr><td>VKF WebAssembly · Firefox (SpiderMonkey)</td><td>39.900 ± 5.859</td><td>5.66×</td></tr><tr><td>VKF WebAssembly · Safari (JavaScriptCore)</td><td>28.200 ± 3.120</td><td>4.00×</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p><a href=\"https://vektorflow.org/benchmarks/browser-0.4.3.html\">Benchmark evidence</a></p><p><a href=\"https://vektorflow.org/downloads/v0.4.3/manifest.json\">Release files and checksums</a></p></section>\n<section class=\"release-panel\" data-release-version=\"0.4.0\" hidden><p>Full 1,000-run native performance gate. No same-host VKF native-versus-WebAssembly benchmark was published for this release.</p><p><a href=\"https://vektorflow.org/downloads/v0.4.0/manifest.json\">Release files and checksums</a></p></section>\n<h2 id=\"inspect-the-evidence\">Inspect the evidence</h2>\n<p><a href=\"./reference/benchmarks/core-comparison/README.html\">Methodology and reproduction</a> · <a href=\"./execution.html\">How policy search works</a>.</p>\n<p>The separate <a href=\"./reference/benchmarks/linalg-comparison/README.html\">linear-algebra</a> and <a href=\"./reference/benchmarks/symbolic-comparison/README.html\">symbolic-mathematics</a> laboratories cover their own workloads and competitors. They are not mixed into this table.</p>","headings":[{"level":1,"title":"Performance","id":"performance"},{"level":2,"title":"Native language comparison","id":"native-language-comparison"},{"level":2,"title":"VKF native versus WebAssembly","id":"vkf-native-versus-webassembly"},{"level":2,"title":"Inspect the evidence","id":"inspect-the-evidence"}],"examples":[],"source":"docs/site/performance.md","route":"performance.html","releaseCatalog":{"schema":"vektor-flow/release-catalog-v1","latest":"0.4.5","latestBrowserRuntime":{"version":"0.4.5","url":"https://vektorflow.org/runtimes/v0.4.5/vkf-shared-compiler.wasm?sha256=0146e4996ebb505f9fc4808f4825282ad5783ee9021e738a19ad568aaf3e366c"},"releases":[{"version":"0.4.0","tag":"v0.4.0","status":"published","browserRuntimeWasm":null,"benchmarkTier":"feature","benchmark":{"summary":"Full 1,000-run native performance gate.","browser":null,"evidenceUrl":"https://vektorflow.org/downloads/v0.4.0/manifest.json"},"downloads":{"windows":{"installer":"https://vektorflow.org/downloads/v0.4.0/vektor-flow-windows-x64-setup.exe?sha256=37d5fb97a64e790067d405a75b404346ae0489bcb77a32cf30687d1215992ec2","archive":"https://vektorflow.org/downloads/v0.4.0/vektor-flow-windows-x64.zip?sha256=131313dec53f0785f644b9e8c67632c7a12fd1883035140235ee55f89ae9c4ac"},"linux":{"installer":"https://vektorflow.org/downloads/v0.4.0/vektor-flow-linux-x64.deb?sha256=4d7